+# BLUE CURRENT V52.10.0 — PILOT CLOSEOUT & OUTCOME REVIEW
+
+V52.6–V52.10 closes the controlled pilot with evidence before any expansion decision.
+
+## Closeout gates
+
+1. PILOT_STABLE
+2. OBJECTIVE_REVIEW
+3. OPERATOR_FEEDBACK
+4. GUEST_IMPACT_SUMMARY
+5. INCIDENT_CLOSEOUT
+6. SUPPORT_BURDEN
+7. DATA_KPI_CONFIDENCE
+8. DEBT_REGISTER
+9. LESSONS_LEARNED
+10. EXPANSION_PREREQUISITES
+
+## Closeout review
+
+A closeout review requires a prior human STABLE stabilization decision and records:
+
+- objective/outcome summary
+- operator feedback
+- guest-impact summary
+- incident closeout
+- support burden
+- data/KPI confidence
+- unresolved debt
+- lessons learned
+- expansion prerequisites
+
+High/critical unresolved debt remains visible and prevents the normal expansion-ready path.
+
+## Human expansion decision
+
+Final human decisions:
+
+- EXPAND
+- HOLD
+- RETIRE
+
+EXPAND normally requires all 10 closeout/readiness gates.
+
+HOLD and RETIRE require a documented reason.
+
+An EXPAND decision does not deploy another restaurant.
+
+A RETIRE decision does not automatically retire the pilot environment.
+
+## Current authenticated runtime
+
+Current untouched state:
+
+`pilot-closeout-required`
+
+All five locations currently show 0/10 closeout gates because no authoritative V52 stabilization STABLE decision has yet been recorded.
+
+## Safety policy
+
+- stable pilot required for closeout
+- operator feedback required
+- guest impact summary required
+- incident closeout required
+- unresolved debt remains visible
+- expansion prerequisites human reviewed
+- human EXPAND/HOLD/RETIRE required
+- EXPAND does not deploy
+- no automatic multi-location rollout
+- no automatic pilot retirement
+- autonomous production changes false
+
+## Validation
+
+- V52.10 focused lifecycle PASS
+- V52.5 regression PASS
+- authenticated V52.10 endpoint PASS
+- authoritative database unchanged
+- duplicate HTML IDs: 0
+- npm run check PASS
+- 959 JavaScript files
+- 798 client scripts
+- 5,983 unique HTML IDs
+
+## Next
+
+V52.11–V52.15 — Expansion Readiness & Replication Package.
